. The summary says what happened and that the cause of the v5.1.0 problem still needs investigating.\n\nI only checked two other possible names (payments-service and payment-service), and neither exists. So if other payments services were also part of this morning's deploy, I haven't looked at them.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01HueAtoYBabGTfEfm3mVxjs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_012KwqGnYp5CqttBAiY3jXcQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Bm6P5srjG7hUMrdnvEQcmv", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_018WPwo5xcxMSNezbHfnWJHs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01RQpiBb9Vmg5MkyeSS8ZSLP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_015qkYsmRivHsHr6MepsNV88", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payment-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01EHvwWzQTuhbWf7cTW7uVG1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01XKSPZhFVkA62W28XncfiVn", "caller": {